Some references
- A similar study showing an important error, as it does not control for network sizes. https://
arxiv.org/abs/2211.00161.
- Some discussion on reservoir computing as a tool to understand the brain https://doi.org/
10.1098/rstb.2018.0377. Another brief review https://arxiv.org/html/2412.13212v1
- A hands-on tutorial on how to build reservoirs (in Julia) https://www.martinuzzi.net/posts/
a-brief-introduction-to-reservoir-computing/
- Connectomic dataset preprocessed: https://braingraph.org/cms/. On the HCP data collec-
tion, original publications, etc.: https://www.humanconnectome.org/
